          "type": "text",
          "text": "On a line graph, the horizontal distance from 2016 to 2017 is 3 cm and the distance from 2017 to 2021 is also 3 cm. How many times too short is the second interval, if the scale of the first interval is correct? Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "1.4",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
        "canonical_answer": "4",
        "canonical_latex": "4",
        "accepted_answers": [],
        "absolute_tolerance": null,
        "rounding_precision": null,
        "unit": null
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "stage": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Find how many years each 3 cm interval actually covers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The second interval should be as long as one year's distance multiplied by the number of years it covers. Compare that length with the 3 cm drawn."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The first interval shows 1 year in 3 cm, and the second covers "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "2021-2017=4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " years."
            }
          ],
          "mark_type": "M",
          "mark_value": 1
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The second interval should be "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "4\\times3=12"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " cm, so it is "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "12\\div3=4"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " times too short."
            }
          ],
